WEBVTT

00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:12.490
So, Ieyasu-chan,

00:00:13.410 --> 00:00:16.370
what did Nobunaga's letter have to say?

00:00:16.370 --> 00:00:18.100
Right, Sister...

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:26.000
Apparently, she desires the 
Imagawa family's Crimson Armor.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:27.760
The Crimson Armor?

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:32.480
The one comprised solely of a left leg?

00:00:32.480 --> 00:00:34.270
Why would she want that?

00:00:34.270 --> 00:00:35.150
I do not know.

00:00:35.150 --> 00:00:36.320
She didn't say.

00:00:38.530 --> 00:00:40.330
What shall we do?

00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:42.850
The weather's nice, isn't it?

00:00:45.320 --> 00:00:48.750
It seems Nobunaga-san 
will be here soon.

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:52.650
Lately, I've been so bored.

00:00:52.650 --> 00:00:56.510
It might be fun to play 
outdoors, for once.

00:00:59.640 --> 00:01:01.330
I can't wait!

00:01:01.720 --> 00:01:04.730
Come, Nobunaga-dono!

00:02:38.010 --> 00:02:42.970
<b>Episode 3</b>

00:02:38.010 --> 00:02:42.970
<b>Sky Maiden</b>

00:02:59.250 --> 00:03:05.160
My lord, Imagawa Yoshimoto-dono's 
lands lie beyond that hill.

00:03:08.790 --> 00:03:12.740
Stop it! Please calm down!

00:03:12.740 --> 00:03:15.300
If you're to be a warrior,
you must become

00:03:15.300 --> 00:03:17.010
accustomed to handling a horse.

00:03:17.010 --> 00:03:20.630
But... But I'm not a warrior!

00:03:23.370 --> 00:03:24.800
The Crimson Armor?

00:03:25.330 --> 00:03:26.400
Yes.

00:03:26.400 --> 00:03:27.710
You remember, right?

00:03:27.710 --> 00:03:29.580
The thing we talked about?

00:03:29.580 --> 00:03:31.090
Um...

00:03:31.090 --> 00:03:32.810
You forgot?

00:03:33.110 --> 00:03:34.270
I remember!

00:03:34.270 --> 00:03:37.230
Of course I remember! Jeez...

00:03:37.230 --> 00:03:38.780
The Crimson Armor.

00:03:39.230 --> 00:03:42.880
It's said that the lord who wears 
it will surely unite the land.

00:03:43.300 --> 00:03:46.700
You vowed to help me find it.

00:03:47.260 --> 00:03:48.350
Right!

00:03:48.350 --> 00:03:49.220
That's right!

00:03:49.220 --> 00:03:50.450
I remember.

00:03:50.880 --> 00:03:54.000
But doesn't that mean you did forget?

00:03:55.920 --> 00:03:58.270
I conducted my own research recently,

00:03:58.270 --> 00:04:04.180
and the armor's left leg lies with 
nearby Imagawa Yoshimoto-dono.

00:04:04.610 --> 00:04:06.300
Imagawa Yoshimoto.

00:04:06.300 --> 00:04:07.010
Yes.

00:04:07.820 --> 00:04:09.340
Descended from ancient nobles,

00:04:09.340 --> 00:04:12.290
she's said to be the best with a bow,

00:04:12.290 --> 00:04:14.110
of all from the nearby lands.

00:04:14.110 --> 00:04:16.240
She possesses both great 
wealth and a vast army.

00:04:18.720 --> 00:04:22.190
Ieyasu is with her, as well, isn't she?

00:04:22.480 --> 00:04:24.720
Yes, for three years now.

00:04:25.040 --> 00:04:26.240
Ieyasu-san?

00:04:26.400 --> 00:04:29.540
I've already sent a 
message to Yoshimoto.

00:04:29.890 --> 00:04:33.780
We'll soon go there directly 
to negotiate for the armor.

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:36.910
When we do, you will accompany us.

00:04:37.630 --> 00:04:38.720
All right!

00:04:38.720 --> 00:04:39.720
That's fine!

00:04:39.720 --> 00:04:40.870
Totally OK!

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:45.250
It hurts...

00:04:45.550 --> 00:04:46.610
You look so pathetic.

00:04:46.610 --> 00:04:48.210
I can't help it!

00:04:48.210 --> 00:04:50.260
I'm just a normal middle school girl!

00:04:50.260 --> 00:04:52.810
And I'm hungry!

00:04:52.810 --> 00:04:55.900
My butt hurts from riding 
this horse so much.

00:04:55.900 --> 00:04:57.980
You do nothing but complain.

00:04:58.480 --> 00:05:00.030
Don't say that, Mitsuhide.

00:05:00.510 --> 00:05:01.720
My lord!

00:05:01.720 --> 00:05:05.150
I think there was a tea 
house up the road a bit.

00:05:05.150 --> 00:05:07.830
This area is famous 
for its Abekawa mochi.

00:05:07.830 --> 00:05:09.030
Abekawa mochi?

00:05:09.990 --> 00:05:12.250
Small, fluffy balls of mochi,

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:15.080
with sugar-laden soy powder, 
sprinkled with anko.

00:05:15.080 --> 00:05:17.800
Traditional Japanese 
collaboration sweets!

00:05:18.630 --> 00:05:20.350
I want sweets!

00:05:20.350 --> 00:05:21.120
Let's go!

00:05:20.620 --> 00:05:22.060
Stop it!

00:05:22.060 --> 00:05:23.310
The horse will buck again!

00:05:24.960 --> 00:05:26.130
Hideyoshi!

00:05:27.690 --> 00:05:29.120
Hideyoshi...

00:05:33.250 --> 00:05:34.440
Ow...

00:05:34.440 --> 00:05:35.480
Hideyoshi!

00:05:40.820 --> 00:05:42.160
My lord...

00:05:42.740 --> 00:05:45.830
You're late, Nobunaga-dono.

00:05:48.650 --> 00:05:50.320
You kept me waiting.

00:05:53.860 --> 00:05:55.330
Yoshimoto-dono.

00:05:55.980 --> 00:05:58.960
Greetings, Nobunaga-dono.

00:05:59.780 --> 00:06:01.280
So this is how it will be, Yoshimoto?

00:06:01.280 --> 00:06:02.170
My lord!

00:06:02.620 --> 00:06:04.090
Why do you stop me?

00:06:04.090 --> 00:06:04.960
Calm down!

00:06:04.960 --> 00:06:06.260
We should be careful...

00:06:07.500 --> 00:06:08.450
Hi!

00:06:08.450 --> 00:06:09.630
Tokunyan!

00:06:09.630 --> 00:06:11.210
It's me! It's me!

00:06:11.210 --> 00:06:12.650
Hideyoshi!

00:06:12.920 --> 00:06:15.540
You know her, Ieyasu-chan ?

00:06:15.540 --> 00:06:16.690
No...

00:06:16.690 --> 00:06:19.980
But she appears to be waving at you.

00:06:19.980 --> 00:06:21.400
She does.

00:06:23.470 --> 00:06:24.520
It sounds bothersome.

00:06:24.520 --> 00:06:25.270
Let's get her.

00:06:25.270 --> 00:06:25.730
Right.

00:06:25.730 --> 00:06:28.990
Hey, Toku-nyan! Ya-hoo!

00:06:32.800 --> 00:06:33.950
Yoshimoto-dono!

00:06:33.950 --> 00:06:35.040
What is this?

00:06:35.640 --> 00:06:38.270
You must have received 
my lord's message!

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:41.130
Yes, I did.

00:06:41.130 --> 00:06:42.420
Then why...

00:06:43.570 --> 00:06:49.330
To me, the Crimson Armor 
you seek is but junk.

00:06:49.330 --> 00:06:50.260
Then...

00:06:50.550 --> 00:06:51.880
But even so,

00:06:51.880 --> 00:06:58.470
I cannot find a reason within 
myself to simply give it to you.

00:06:58.470 --> 00:07:00.230
We know!

00:07:00.230 --> 00:07:01.360
That's why we've come...

00:07:01.360 --> 00:07:04.860
But if you truly desire it...

00:07:10.400 --> 00:07:12.200
Make it all the way to here.

00:07:13.280 --> 00:07:16.210
Of course, if you believe 
yourself able to break

00:07:16.210 --> 00:07:18.690
through this many of my soldiers...

00:07:53.530 --> 00:07:55.100
It hurts...

00:07:56.660 --> 00:07:59.130
I'm so sorry, my lord.

00:07:59.130 --> 00:08:01.070
This is all my fault.

00:08:01.070 --> 00:08:02.830
I shall commit harakiri to apologize...

00:08:03.660 --> 00:08:04.450
Wait! Wait!

00:08:04.450 --> 00:08:05.630
Stop!

00:08:06.330 --> 00:08:08.380
It isn't your fault, Mitsuhide.

00:08:08.800 --> 00:08:13.210
If anything, the fault is 
mine for underestimating her.

00:08:13.530 --> 00:08:14.590
My lord...

00:08:15.070 --> 00:08:21.130
But now it's clear:
Yoshimoto has the Crimson Armor.

00:08:21.390 --> 00:08:23.720
That's more than enough.

00:08:23.720 --> 00:08:28.000
Then we'll gather our 
forces and attack?

00:08:28.980 --> 00:08:30.870
No! You can't have a war!

00:08:30.870 --> 00:08:32.270
No one's asking you!

00:08:32.270 --> 00:08:32.990
But...

00:08:33.310 --> 00:08:35.610
Do not raise our forces over this!

00:08:36.210 --> 00:08:39.190
Yoshimoto has no real intent to fight.

00:08:39.190 --> 00:08:41.690
For her, it's merely a way to kill time.

00:08:41.690 --> 00:08:42.620
That should be obvious.

00:08:42.620 --> 00:08:44.400
Amazing!

00:08:44.400 --> 00:08:45.710
How can you tell?

00:08:45.710 --> 00:08:48.190
I said it should be obvious!

00:08:48.190 --> 00:08:50.130
Amazing!

00:08:50.870 --> 00:08:52.350
But, my lord...

00:08:52.350 --> 00:08:55.310
We can't ignore this.

00:08:55.310 --> 00:08:56.950
She's a child, picking a fight.

00:08:57.580 --> 00:08:58.700
And when someone picks a fight with me,

00:08:58.700 --> 00:08:59.980
I give them double what they asked for!

00:08:59.980 --> 00:09:01.350
That's my style.

00:09:02.940 --> 00:09:05.370
What would you do at a time like this?

00:09:05.840 --> 00:09:06.780
Me?

00:09:06.780 --> 00:09:07.650
My lord!

00:09:08.450 --> 00:09:13.070
Um... At a time like this...

00:09:13.070 --> 00:09:14.650
Um...

00:09:15.170 --> 00:09:16.110
I know!

00:09:16.110 --> 00:09:17.160
Recreation!

00:09:18.340 --> 00:09:19.870
What about that?

00:09:21.240 --> 00:09:23.480
Re... Creation?

00:09:23.480 --> 00:09:24.390
That's right!

00:09:24.390 --> 00:09:25.620
Recreation.

00:09:28.200 --> 00:09:30.310
Recreation...

00:09:41.100 --> 00:09:46.170
Did you see their faces, Ieyasu-chan?

00:09:46.170 --> 00:09:47.000
Yes.

00:09:47.000 --> 00:09:49.420
That was truly hilarious.

00:09:49.810 --> 00:09:53.360
Sister, she's sent another missive.

00:09:53.800 --> 00:09:54.780
Oh, my.

00:09:55.060 --> 00:09:57.800
Has she requested peace 
negotiations this time?

00:09:58.880 --> 00:09:59.780
I'll read it.

00:10:01.310 --> 00:10:04.080
"To Imagawa Yoshimoto-dono,

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:08.290
the failure of a general, 
clinging to her bloodline.

00:10:09.100 --> 00:10:12.070
If you have more pride 
than a base insect,

00:10:12.070 --> 00:10:14.870
then you should settle things 
between us as generals,

00:10:14.870 --> 00:10:16.550
rather than rely on your numbers!

00:10:16.740 --> 00:10:18.730
I will wait at Okehazama.

00:10:18.730 --> 00:10:22.490
If you arrive late, you will be 
a laughingstock for generations."

00:10:23.540 --> 00:10:24.990
Is what's written.

00:10:33.660 --> 00:10:35.110
She fell for it.

00:10:41.640 --> 00:10:52.110
<b>Okehazama</b>

00:10:42.300 --> 00:10:45.110
After receiving your kind letter,

00:10:45.110 --> 00:10:49.380
I came as quickly as I 
could, Nobunaga-dono.

00:10:49.790 --> 00:10:53.580
I'm glad you appreciated 
it, Yoshimoto-dono.

00:10:54.160 --> 00:10:56.870
So, then how shall we settle this?

00:10:57.210 --> 00:10:58.440
If you like,

00:10:58.440 --> 00:11:01.010
I'm prepared to show you 
whence my reputation

00:11:01.010 --> 00:11:03.970
as the finest bow master 
in Kaidou derives.

00:11:04.570 --> 00:11:05.650
That sounds fun.

00:11:06.550 --> 00:11:08.580
That's not what I meant!

00:11:08.580 --> 00:11:09.980
However!

00:11:11.270 --> 00:11:14.600
I have no intention of 
taking your life over this.

00:11:15.530 --> 00:11:17.480
Thus, I suggest this:

00:11:17.800 --> 00:11:20.400
We fight with...

00:11:22.800 --> 00:11:24.830
Recreation!

00:11:27.080 --> 00:11:30.600
With recreation shall I conquer!

00:11:32.140 --> 00:11:34.960
That's not right at all!

00:11:44.990 --> 00:11:47.450
<b>Okehazama</b>

00:11:48.960 --> 00:11:50.770
Three rounds.

00:11:50.770 --> 00:11:52.760
The first to win two will be the victor.

00:11:53.070 --> 00:11:58.610
We shall each draw from a box 
and enact what's written there.

00:11:58.840 --> 00:12:01.110
This is named Recreation.

00:12:01.110 --> 00:12:03.410
That's how you do it, but...

00:12:03.980 --> 00:12:07.300
Can we write some of the choices, too?

00:12:07.300 --> 00:12:08.500
Of course.

00:12:08.500 --> 00:12:10.550
That's fair.

00:12:11.180 --> 00:12:14.000
I'll write "Archery" on all of them.

00:12:14.520 --> 00:12:18.440
If you believe you cannot win 
by any other means, then do so.

00:12:20.020 --> 00:12:23.630
You're very good at screwing 
with Sister, Nobunaga-san.

00:12:24.430 --> 00:12:25.390
Any objections?

00:12:25.980 --> 00:12:28.830
Why don't we forget the "best of three"

00:12:28.830 --> 00:12:31.930
and continue playing 
until they all are gone?

00:12:32.900 --> 00:12:36.610
If you don't think you can win,
you're free to refuse.

00:12:37.100 --> 00:12:39.640
You're embarrassing 
yourself with that bravado.

00:12:39.640 --> 00:12:40.780
What was that?!

00:12:54.800 --> 00:12:56.000
She fell for it again.

00:12:56.250 --> 00:12:58.250
That's not it!

00:12:58.250 --> 00:13:00.500
This is just getting worse...

00:13:00.720 --> 00:13:03.260
OK, let us begin!

00:13:07.390 --> 00:13:08.390
<b>Sumo</b>

00:13:11.050 --> 00:13:12.350
Ready!

00:13:12.660 --> 00:13:16.300
Still in! Still in! Still in!

00:13:16.690 --> 00:13:17.440
Go, Mitsuhide!

00:13:17.440 --> 00:13:18.440
Throw her!

00:13:19.500 --> 00:13:20.710
Falling out!

00:13:20.710 --> 00:13:22.870
A lot of stuff looks 
like it's falling out!

00:13:28.200 --> 00:13:29.210
Ieyasu!

00:13:29.210 --> 00:13:32.030
Tokugawa Ieyasu!

00:13:32.030 --> 00:13:33.830
You let your guard down, Mitsuhide.

00:13:34.300 --> 00:13:35.620
That was strange.

00:13:35.620 --> 00:13:37.620
It felt like something hit my foot...

00:13:37.650 --> 00:13:38.810
Imagawa

00:13:37.650 --> 00:13:38.810
Oda

00:13:38.830 --> 00:13:39.920
<b>Beach Volleyball</b>

00:13:41.400 --> 00:13:42.000
Here!

00:13:45.480 --> 00:13:46.680
All right!

00:13:46.810 --> 00:13:49.300
Congratulations, my lord.

00:13:50.160 --> 00:13:53.410
I've never done that before, 
but it was enjoyable.

00:13:53.410 --> 00:13:55.060
That was like real recreation!

00:13:55.060 --> 00:13:56.140
Imagawa

00:13:55.060 --> 00:13:56.140
Oda

00:13:56.140 --> 00:13:57.310
<b>Karuta</b>

00:13:57.560 --> 00:13:59.570
I'm counting on you, Hideyoshi.

00:14:00.310 --> 00:14:01.490
Why me?

00:14:00.310 --> 00:14:02.320
Chi ha ya bu ru...

00:14:02.320 --> 00:14:03.570
<b>Bowling</b>

00:14:05.630 --> 00:14:07.360
Wow!

00:14:05.990 --> 00:14:07.360
You did it, Mitsuhide!

00:14:07.360 --> 00:14:08.240
Horseback Archery

00:14:08.240 --> 00:14:09.070
Swimming

00:14:09.070 --> 00:14:09.950
<b>Patty-cake</b>

00:14:17.870 --> 00:14:21.460
We've each won the 
same number of slips.

00:14:21.460 --> 00:14:23.420
Not bad...

00:14:23.910 --> 00:14:25.660
You, either...

00:14:25.660 --> 00:14:28.840
No... No more...

00:14:28.840 --> 00:14:29.840
OK!

00:14:29.840 --> 00:14:31.720
This is the last one!

00:14:32.990 --> 00:14:35.380
The last match is...

00:14:35.380 --> 00:14:36.390
This!

00:14:36.390 --> 00:14:38.600
<b>Kite-Fighting</b>

00:14:48.830 --> 00:14:52.170
This will finish our match, at last.

00:14:52.170 --> 00:14:56.050
I didn't expect you to 
give me so much trouble.

00:14:56.050 --> 00:14:57.870
Wait!

00:14:58.630 --> 00:15:00.890
Why am I here?

00:15:00.890 --> 00:15:02.110
It can't be helped.

00:15:02.110 --> 00:15:04.440
You weigh the least.

00:15:05.520 --> 00:15:07.840
I'm never dieting again!

00:15:08.830 --> 00:15:14.190
This match's winner retains 
the Crimson Armor's left leg!

00:15:17.220 --> 00:15:19.150
No complaints now, right?

00:15:19.150 --> 00:15:21.020
A warrior never goes 
back on their word!

00:15:21.770 --> 00:15:24.340
Rope-bearers, are you ready?

00:15:24.340 --> 00:15:25.740
Yes!

00:15:24.340 --> 00:15:25.740
Indeed!

00:15:26.590 --> 00:15:28.280
Begin!

00:15:30.990 --> 00:15:32.300
What's that timer?

00:15:33.250 --> 00:15:36.130
Wait! I'm floating! I'm floating!

00:15:44.220 --> 00:15:45.980
It's started!

00:15:45.980 --> 00:15:47.130
I'm so high...

00:15:47.130 --> 00:15:49.000
This is kite-fighting, right?

00:15:49.000 --> 00:15:50.510
Is this it?

00:15:58.090 --> 00:15:59.860
Something's begun!

00:15:59.860 --> 00:16:01.810
Don't let down your guard, Hideyoshi!

00:16:04.810 --> 00:16:08.230
I have nothing against you,
but this is a battle.

00:16:08.340 --> 00:16:09.900
Wait!

00:16:09.900 --> 00:16:10.990
No one told me about this!

00:16:20.380 --> 00:16:21.640
Very well.

00:16:21.640 --> 00:16:22.710
I'll do this for real.

00:16:24.300 --> 00:16:25.990
I'm sorry!

00:16:29.120 --> 00:16:30.460
Not bad, Yoshimoto!

00:16:33.320 --> 00:16:34.470
You, too...

00:16:34.760 --> 00:16:35.580
Wait!

00:16:35.580 --> 00:16:36.620
Wait!

00:16:36.620 --> 00:16:37.820
I lose!

00:16:37.820 --> 00:16:40.790
I lose, OK?

00:16:40.790 --> 00:16:43.750
I won't be deceived by that.

00:16:45.010 --> 00:16:46.650
I'm not fooling you!

00:16:48.890 --> 00:16:50.000
It's time!

00:16:50.540 --> 00:16:51.570
I'll light the fires.

00:16:53.470 --> 00:16:54.350
What's that?

00:16:54.350 --> 00:16:55.430
What's that?

00:16:55.430 --> 00:16:57.590
A fuse is wrapped around the rope.

00:16:59.250 --> 00:17:02.090
A large firework is 
strapped to the back,

00:17:02.090 --> 00:17:04.560
to be lit after a certain time.

00:17:04.560 --> 00:17:05.870
No one told me!

00:17:06.110 --> 00:17:07.620
That's kite-fighting!

00:17:08.240 --> 00:17:12.240
No, that's not the kite-fighting I know!

00:17:12.240 --> 00:17:17.600
But I secretly cut the fuse on mine, 
so it will burn out first.

00:17:17.980 --> 00:17:19.460
Ieyasu-chan!

00:17:20.400 --> 00:17:21.710
Hi!

00:17:21.710 --> 00:17:27.190
Your fuse was cut, so I 
replaced it with a new one!

00:17:30.880 --> 00:17:32.890
I'm still fine.

00:17:32.890 --> 00:17:34.860
The firework was fake, 
without gunpowder...

00:17:35.150 --> 00:17:37.870
And I replaced your firework, too!

00:17:41.020 --> 00:17:43.750
Very sporting of you, Yoshimoto.

00:17:43.750 --> 00:17:46.370
"Fair and square" is my motto.

00:17:46.500 --> 00:17:47.420
No!

00:17:47.420 --> 00:17:48.380
Stop it!

00:17:48.380 --> 00:17:49.590
No!

00:18:00.400 --> 00:18:01.180
Tokunyan!

00:18:04.920 --> 00:18:06.190
Ieyasu-chan?!

00:18:16.270 --> 00:18:17.200
Tokunyan!

00:18:20.860 --> 00:18:22.600
Well done, Hideyoshi!

00:18:22.600 --> 00:18:27.500
Your desire to show an 
enemy pity impresses me!

00:18:29.170 --> 00:18:30.770
No!

00:18:34.630 --> 00:18:36.610
Grab her, Hideyoshi!

00:18:40.660 --> 00:18:41.800
Tokunyan!

00:18:42.640 --> 00:18:44.090
Hideyoshi-san...

00:18:49.960 --> 00:18:51.130
Hideyoshi-san!

00:18:53.080 --> 00:18:54.320
Tokunyan...

00:19:48.180 --> 00:19:49.350
Are you sure?

00:19:49.670 --> 00:19:50.650
Yes.

00:19:50.650 --> 00:19:54.340
It was close, but I lost.

00:19:55.020 --> 00:19:55.870
I see.

00:19:56.380 --> 00:19:59.050
The general who wears the Crimson Armor

00:19:59.050 --> 00:20:01.050
will conquer the land... Right?

00:20:02.010 --> 00:20:05.550
You have big dreams, Nobunaga-dono.

00:20:06.300 --> 00:20:09.840
You aren't interested in that, Sister?

00:20:10.600 --> 00:20:14.800
I prefer to spend my days having fun.

00:20:15.170 --> 00:20:19.310
And watching Nobunaga-dono is more fun.

00:20:19.880 --> 00:20:22.290
Let's go home, Ieyasu-chan.

00:20:22.290 --> 00:20:23.040
Yes.

00:20:23.970 --> 00:20:25.070
Yoshimoto...

00:20:33.060 --> 00:20:37.710
This Crimson Armor, which lets 
one conquer, interests me.

00:20:40.350 --> 00:20:44.130
When Nobunaga-san gathers it all...

00:20:45.760 --> 00:20:47.990
That was awful!

00:20:48.460 --> 00:20:49.840
Don't complain.

00:20:49.840 --> 00:20:55.410
We were able to get the Crimson 
Armor piece through your help.

00:20:55.410 --> 00:20:56.330
But...

00:20:56.330 --> 00:20:57.110
Here is your reward.

00:20:59.010 --> 00:21:00.400
Abekawa mochi!

00:21:00.860 --> 00:21:03.260
I asked Yoshimoto for them.

00:21:03.260 --> 00:21:04.750
Thank you, my lord!

00:21:05.680 --> 00:21:07.950
Eat all you like!

00:21:10.820 --> 00:21:14.700
Yoshimoto was actually 
killed at Okehazama?

00:21:15.050 --> 00:21:17.080
It's famous.

00:21:17.080 --> 00:21:21.250
Oda Nobunaga's path of 
conquest begins here.

00:21:23.580 --> 00:21:24.790
Oh, right.

00:21:24.790 --> 00:21:26.350
I forgot to mention it,

00:21:26.350 --> 00:21:29.240
but you were peeking when 
we were in the bath!

00:21:30.800 --> 00:21:32.670
Was I?

00:21:32.670 --> 00:21:33.870
Pervert.

00:21:34.350 --> 00:21:35.670
Don't worry.

00:21:35.670 --> 00:21:37.940
I'm not interested in 
those without breasts!

00:21:39.060 --> 00:21:41.170
What does that mean?

00:21:41.170 --> 00:21:42.940
Um, well...

00:21:44.470 --> 00:21:46.450
Take this!

00:23:25.470 --> 00:23:28.660
Sensei, would you like to have 
a tongue-twister battle today?

00:23:28.660 --> 00:23:30.140
A tongue-twister battle?

00:23:30.140 --> 00:23:30.680
Yeah.

00:23:30.680 --> 00:23:32.120
Sure. That sounds fun.

00:23:32.120 --> 00:23:33.090
Here we go.

00:23:33.090 --> 00:23:35.030
Masamunemunemunemunemunemune

00:23:35.030 --> 00:23:36.820
And Munemunemumunemune.

00:23:36.820 --> 00:23:37.730
Here you go.

00:23:38.420 --> 00:23:39.600
All right.

00:23:40.470 --> 00:23:42.260
What if I win?

00:23:42.600 --> 00:23:43.470
Let me see.

00:23:43.470 --> 00:23:44.710
I'll do whatever you say.

00:23:44.710 --> 00:23:47.570
OK, then what if you win?

00:23:49.800 --> 00:23:51.270
Make your classes fun.

00:23:52.490 --> 00:23:54.410
Watch next time, OK?

00:23:52.490 --> 00:23:55.050
Preview

00:23:52.490 --> 00:23:55.500
Confrontation Maiden
